The magnifications of the images can be acquired from the inverse of the determinant of the Jacobian transformation matrix between \\vec{\\beta} and \\vec{\\theta}:

\\mu=\\det\\left(\\frac{\\partial\\vec{\\beta}}{\\partial\\vec{\\theta}}\\right)^{-1}. 

